[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS022
TITLE: Sequence closed traffic and check the readback
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall build general-aviation closed-traffic demand and IFR straight-in demand, sequence those aircraft by a time interval, produce a traffic call, compare a readback with the clearance phrase, and put a go-around back into the sequence. Acceptance is three closed-traffic aircraft with distinct slots, a mismatched readback that fails the check, and a go-around identity placed back in the order.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Most tower memory is the pattern, not a single scripted city pair.
<<<
DAL: B
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: Helicopters are outside this increment. VFR closed traffic and IFR straight-in are the two routine local patterns. Phraseology is a project-owned grammar.
